{"content":[{"c":["REPHAN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Pagan deity mentioned by Stephen in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.7.43","r":"Acts.7.43","rawR":"Acts.7.43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.7.43","value":"Acts.7.43"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 7:43"}," (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Remphan”; ",{"c":["nasb"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Rompha”) when he cited the text of ",{"href":"?bref=Amos.5.26","r":"Amos.5.26","rawR":"Amos.5.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.5.26","value":"Amos.5.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Amos 5:26"}," (",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Kaiwan,” see mg) to portray the paganism of the wandering Israelites. Stephen was quoting from the Septuagint, whose translators had taken ",{"c":["kaiwan"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"}," to refer to the Assyrian god of Saturn, or perhaps to the Egyptian Saturn god Repa. Some scholars argue that ",{"href":"?bref=Amos.5.26","r":"Amos.5.26","rawR":"Amos.5.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.5.26","value":"Amos.5.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Amos 5:26"}," is a general reference to the Israelites’ wilderness paganism and names no ancient deities at all."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Rephan","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Acts 7:43","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.7.43","rawQueryValue":"Acts.7.43","sourceRefExact":"Acts.7.43"},{"anchorText":"Amos 5:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.5.26","rawQueryValue":"Amos.5.26","sourceRefExact":"Amos.5.26"},{"anchorText":"Amos 5:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.5.26","rawQueryValue":"Amos.5.26","sourceRefExact":"Amos.5.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"411650c48fdc31a7e0714eccea96d5e46e78467f115a2a6c41f4e696acc4e770","sourceItemName":"Rephan","sourceItemOrder":117,"sourceMember":"Articles/R.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Rephan","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Rephan","title":"Rephan","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}